  m_Text: 'Left / Right arrow (A D)      turn and carve

    Space  or  Up arrow           jump over trees

    Left Shift                    tuck and boost

    Down arrow (S)                brake


    Collect snowflakes and land spins (180 / 360 / 540).

    Chain moves to raise the score multiplier up to x5.

    Hitting a tree costs a life - ice patches only slow you down.'
